WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.246
The project manager sees two assigned
projects.

00:00:03.246 --> 00:00:06.024
Open Harbor Lights Benefit Gala to review

00:00:06.024 --> 00:00:08.643
the work delegated for that event.

00:00:09.692 --> 00:00:12.599
The evening run of show is ready.

00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:15.506
Mark the approval task Done and save.

00:00:15.506 --> 00:00:18.795
The project board now shows one completed
task.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.659
This gala also grants CRM access.

00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:26.986
Open the sponsorship liaison, move the
record to Contacted,

00:00:26.986 --> 00:00:30.633
and save the agreed follow-up and briefing
note.

00:00:31.684 --> 00:00:35.631
Return to the workspace and open Tidepool
Learning Day.

00:00:35.631 --> 00:00:39.168
The manager can read the meeting-point task
here.

00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:41.882
This assignment grants viewing access only.

00:00:42.931 --> 00:00:45.694
Return to the workspace to see the

00:00:45.694 --> 00:00:47.904
updated progress across both assignments.

00:00:47.904 --> 00:00:50.509
Sign out to close this review.
